### ===================================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK & KATALOG API
### ===================================================================

### 1.1 Cek Status Server & Daftar Endpoint (PRD Alignment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 2. AUTENTIKASI & AKUN (FR-01, FR-02)
### ===================================================================

### 2.1 Login Penulis (Mahasiswa) — Menggunakan Email & Password
# @name loginPenulis
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amanda@campus.ac.id",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "penulis"
}

### 2.2 Login Kurator Perpustakaan — Menggunakan NIP / Email & Password
# @name loginKurator
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "rina.suryani@campus.ac.id",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "kurator"
}

### 2.3 Cek Profil Pengguna yang Sedang Login (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{penulisToken}}

### 2.4 Registrasi Akun Baru (Input Kredensial Sendiri)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Budi Pratama",
  "email": "budi.pratama@campus.ac.id",
  "nim": "2210512999",
  "password": "password123",
  "prodi": "Teknik Informatika",
  "role": "penulis"
}

### 2.5 Keluar Akun (Logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 3. PENCARIAN & PENJELAJAHAN PUBLIK (FR-30, FR-31, FR-34)
### ===================================================================

### 3.1 Beranda — Karya Terbaru & Terpopuler (FR-34)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya/beranda?limit=6

### 3.2 Jelajah Karya Terbit — Semua Karya Diterbitkan (FR-30)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya

### 3.3 Pencarian Berdasarkan Kata Kunci (FR-30)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya?q=learning

### 3.4 Filter Berdasarkan Jenis Karya, Prodi, dan Tahun (FR-31)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya?jenis=skripsi&prodi=ti&tahun=2026

### 3.5 Pengurutan Terpopuler / Unduhan Terbanyak (FR-31)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya?sort=terpopuler

### 3.6 Detail Lengkap Satu Karya Ilmiah (FR-32, FR-41)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya/2024-819


### ===================================================================
### 4. PENGAJUAN & PENGELOLAAN NASKAH PENULIS (FR-10, FR-14, FR-15)
### ===================================================================

### 4.1 Karya Saya — Daftar Naskah Milik Penulis yang Sedang Login (FR-15)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya/saya
Authorization: Bearer {{penulisToken}}

### 4.2 Simpan Naskah Baru sebagai DRAFT (FR-10)
# @name buatDraft
POST {{baseUrl}}/karya
Authorization: Bearer {{penulisToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Analisis Performa Model Arsitektur Microservices Menggunakan Go dan gRPC",
  "pembimbing": "Dr. Eng. Hendra Sucipto, S.Kom., M.T.",
  "jenis": "skripsi",
  "prodi": "Teknik Informatika",
  "tahun": 2026,
  "abstrak": "Penelitian ini mengevaluasi throughput latensi rendah komunikasi RPC antar-service dibandingkan REST API tradisional.",
  "kataKunci": ["Microservices", "gRPC", "Go", "Cloud Native"],
  "status": "Draft"
}

### 4.3 Ajukan Naskah Baru Langsung ke Antrean Kurator (FR-14)
# @name ajukanNaskah
POST {{baseUrl}}/karya
Authorization: Bearer {{penulisToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Pengembangan Sistem Klasifikasi Dokumen Karya Ilmiah Otomatis dengan NLP",
  "pembimbing": "Dr. Eng. Hendra Sucipto, S.Kom., M.T.",
  "jenis": "skripsi",
  "prodi": "Teknik Informatika",
  "tahun": 2026,
  "abstrak": "Sistem klasifikasi teks abstrak karya ilmiah menggunakan metode Transformer IndoBERT untuk pemetaan bidang kajian otomatis repositori kampus.",
  "kataKunci": ["NLP", "IndoBERT", "Klasifikasi Teks", "Repositori Kampus"],
  "status": "Diajukan"
}

### 4.4 Perbarui Draft / Ajukan Ulang Revisi Naskah
PUT {{baseUrl}}/karya/karya-revisi-001
Authorization: Bearer {{penulisToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "abstrak": "Riset evaluasi kegunaan antarmuka mobile kesehatan mental dengan System Usability Scale (SUS) skor 85 setelah perbaikan dewan penguji.",
  "submitForReview": true
}


### ===================================================================
### 5. ALUR REVIEW & KURASI PERPUSTAKAAN (FR-20, FR-23)
### ===================================================================

### 5.1 Antrean Kurator — Naskah Status Diajukan & Dalam Review (FR-20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya/antrean
Authorization: Bearer {{kuratorToken}}

### 5.2 Mulai Review Naskah (Ubah Status ke 'Dalam Review')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/karya/karya-review-001/start-review
Authorization: Bearer {{kuratorToken}}

### 5.3 Keputusan Kurator: MINTA REVISI (dengan Catatan Wajib) (FR-23)
POST {{baseUrl}}/karya/karya-review-001/review
Authorization: Bearer {{kuratorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tindakan": "revisi",
  "catatan": "Mohon perbaiki format penulisan daftar pustaka sesuai standar IEEE dan lampirkan lembar pengesahan pembimbing."
}

### 5.4 Keputusan Kurator: TERBITKAN NASKAH (Auto Generate DOI & Tanggal Terbit) (FR-23)
POST {{baseUrl}}/karya/karya-review-001/review
Authorization: Bearer {{kuratorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tindakan": "terbitkan",
  "catatan": "Naskah telah memenuhi semua standar mutu dan layak dipublikasikan ke repositori publik."
}

### 5.5 Keputusan Kurator: TOLAK NASKAH
POST {{baseUrl}}/karya/karya-review-001/review
Authorization: Bearer {{kuratorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tindakan": "tolak",
  "catatan": "Topik naskah tidak sesuai dengan bidang keilmuan program studi."
}


### ===================================================================
### 6. UNDUHAN & STATISTIK REPOSITORI (FR-40, FR-41, FR-42)
### ===================================================================

### 6.1 Catat Unduhan Naskah (FR-40, FR-41)
POST {{baseUrl}}/karya/2024-819/unduh

### 6.2 Unduh Berkas Naskah & Auto-Increment Metrik Unduhan
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya/2024-819/unduh

### 6.3 Ringkasan Statistik Repositori & Dashboard Kurator (FR-42)
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistik

### 6.4 Borang Akreditasi Program Studi (Kriteria 9 BAN-PT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistik/akreditasi


### ===================================================================
### 7. REPOSITORI KESELURUHAN (INTERNAL & ARSIP)
### ===================================================================

### 7.1 Seluruh Naskah Lintas Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/karya/semua


### ===================================================================
### 8. ADMINISTRATOR SISTEM (MANAJEMEN PENGGUNA & OVERRIDE)
### ===================================================================

### 8.1 Login Admin Sistem
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@campus.ac.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 8.2 Ambil Seluruh Daftar Pengguna (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8.3 Tambah Akun Kurator Baru oleh Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Siti Nurhaliza, M.IP.",
  "email": "siti.nurhaliza@campus.ac.id",
  "nip": "199408222021042005",
  "prodi": "UPT Perpustakaan",
  "role": "kurator",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 8.4 Statistik Sistem & Audit Log Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/statistik
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


